Inclusion Criteria:

1. Age ≥18 years at the time of signing the Informed Consent Form (ICF), regardless of gender;
2. Histologically or cytologically confirmed locally advanced (stage IIIB/IIIC) or metastatic (Stage IV) non-squamous NSCLC not amenable to radical surgery and/or radical radiotherapy (regardless of concurrent/sequential chemotherapy) (according to TNM staging of lung cancer published by the Union for International Cancer Control and American Joint Committee on Cancer (UICC/AJCC), 8th edition);
