12. Pregnant or lactating females;
13. In the opinion of the investigator, the subject has other conditions that may affect compliance or are not suitable for participation in this study;
14. Patient has active central nervous system metastases (with or without treatment), including symptomatic brain metastases or meningeal metastases or spinal cord compression, but asymptomatic brain metastases except;
